  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Summon up to three fire hounds (cost per hound); each attacks a different target within range. Each hound deals 5d6 + <span style=\"color:rgb(239, 230, 216);font-family:Signika, 'Palatino Linotype', sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgba(11, 10, 19, 0.9);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline !important;float:none\">{{spellPower}} </span>damage, and forces a Will + {{spellPower}} vs Strength/Dexterity Test.<br>On a failed save, the target loses 1 Action. <br>On a successful save, the target is knocked prone and takes an additional 5d6 + {{spellPower}} Magical + Fire damage, then the hound disappears. <br>If the target succeeds with Margin of Success ≥  50, nothing happens. -20% chance to apply Burning effect.</p>",
